    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n1 days ago Monroe Central had to travel to play their first game of the season, but the final result was worth the trip. They came out on top against the Winchester Community Golden Falcons by a score of 57-46 on Tuesday. This was payback for the Golden Bears, who suffered a 39-37 loss the last time these two teams met. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
